Package: VirtualDairyHerdR
Title: A Digital Dairy Herd Simulator for Education, Research and Precision Livestock Farming
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Vincent", "Tennanty", email = "Vinny93@live.co.uk", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Simulates biologically realistic synthetic dairy herd datasets for
    teaching statistics, data wrangling, visualisation, and machine learning
    in agricultural and precision livestock farming contexts. Part of the
    Farmaverse ecosystem.
